                        "also $ACT_ALLOW, one per line). Only plain single commands qualify - no "
                        "chaining, pipes, redirection, substitution, globs, or quotes - never "
                        "the danger tier and never a catastrophic payload (recursive delete, disk "
                        "destruction, power state). Edits/writes are never covered. "
                        "With --non-interactive this is an allowlist-only fix mode")
